352
00:46:43,059 --> 00:46:44,658
Untuk urusan apa?

353
00:46:51,274 --> 00:46:52,435
Mari...

354
00:47:07,588 --> 00:47:08,622
Halo, Sayang.

355
00:47:08,722 --> 00:47:10,156
Muriel, Sayang

356
00:47:10,256 --> 00:47:12,725
tolong buka kiriman Blackwire terbaru

357
00:47:12,825 --> 00:47:14,490
untuk seorang Daniel Pine.

358
00:47:17,763 --> 00:47:19,361
Daniel Pine...

359
00:47:19,461 --> 00:47:21,330
Kontrak masuk tiga hari lalu.

360
00:47:21,430 --> 00:47:23,303
Nilai buruannya dua juta.

361
00:47:23,403 --> 00:47:25,506
Saat ini dia bersembunyi di
Continental Praha...

362
00:47:25,606 --> 00:47:27,877
<i>kamar 3-1-5.</i>

363
00:47:29,273 --> 00:47:32,146
Tak ada panggilan keluar
yang tercatat,

364
00:47:32,246 --> 00:47:35,775
