365
00:47:36,585 --> 00:47:37,612
Kebanyakan es krim.

366
00:47:38,521 --> 00:47:39,779
Gigi manis, ya?

367
00:47:40,787 --> 00:47:41,787
Tolong cetakan fisiknya.

368
00:47:54,965 --> 00:47:55,971
Pak...

369
00:47:56,869 --> 00:47:57,973
ada telepon untuk Anda.

370
00:47:58,772 --> 00:48:00,239
Dari Direktur.

371
00:48:04,899 --> 00:48:06,632
<font color="#d9ffb9">Semoga beruntung, Nona</font>

372
00:49:10,538 --> 00:49:12,392
<i>Check-in.</i>

373
00:49:13,350 --> 00:49:14,510
Tentu.

374
00:49:14,610 --> 00:49:17,013
Dan berapa lama Anda akan menginap?

375
00:49:17,113 --> 00:49:18,251
Hanya semalam.

376
00:49:20,381 --> 00:49:22,816
Kamar 314, tolong.

377
00:49:45,950 --> 00:49:47,616
<i>Masih belum ada pergerakan dari Pine.</i>

378
00:49:47,716 --> 00:49:49,444
<i>Apa instruksiku?</i>

379
00:49:49,544 --> 00:49:51,114
<i>Terus awasi Pine.</i>

380
00:49:51,214 --> 00:49:52,450
<i>Mungkin kita punya peminat.</i>

381
00:50:08,638 --> 00:50:09,901
Kau benar.

382
00:50:10,001 --> 00:50:12,136
Ada yang menerima kontraknya.

383
00:50:12,236 --> 00:50:14,835
Seorang wanita, muda,
berambut gelap.

384
00:50:18,107 --> 00:50:19,477
Dia sudah masuk.

385
00:50:45,608 --> 00:50:46,608
Siapa kau?

386
00:50:49,005 --> 00:50:50,124
Sial.

387
00:50:50,948 --> 00:50:53,049
Itu kata yang tak boleh diucapkan.

388
00:50:54,815 --> 00:50:56,481
Benar. Maaf.

389
00:50:57,512 --> 00:50:59,649
- Siapa namamu?
- Ella.

390
00:51:00,280 --> 00:51:01,859
Aku Eve.

391
00:51:01,959 --> 00:51:04,225
Kau bukan datang
untuk sakiti Ayahku, kan?

392
00:51:06,728 --> 00:51:07,728
Ayahmu?

393
00:51:23,206 --> 00:51:25,046
Ella, kemari.

394
00:51:25,146 --> 00:51:26,314
Semuanya akan baik-baik saja.

395
00:51:26,414 --> 00:51:28,254
Ayo berdiri di belakangku, Sayang.

396
00:51:32,920 --> 00:51:33,947
Apa yang kau mau?

397
